<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady/up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady/up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers ranged steady to $0.50 higher, instances $1.00 higher. Trading was moderately active.</p>
<p>Steers - load choice predominantly 3 black 1390 lbs 69.50, part load 1450 lbs 69.00. High-select and choice 2-3 1250-1400 lbs 66.50-68.75, some carrying mud 65.00. Select and choice 2-3 1100- 1300 lbs 63.50-66.50. Select 1-2 61.50-63.50.</p>
<p>Heifers - high select and choice 2-3 1100-1275 lbs</p>
<p>66.00-67.25. Select and choice 2-3 1000-1125 lbs 63.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 61.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
